      "leadImage": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/Stahleck_top.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled",
      "source": "Wikipedia"
    },
    "town": {
      "title": "Bacharach",
      "description": "Town in Rhineland-Palatinate, Germany",
      "extract": "Bacharach is a town in the Mainz-Bingen district in Rhineland-Palatinate, Germany. It belongs to the Verbandsgemeinde of Rhein-Nahe, whose seat is in Bingen am Rhein, although that town is not within its bounds.",
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bacharach",
